    "text": "10 hours ago The Houston Astros are trading pitchers Lance McCullers Jr. and Colton Gordon to the Milwaukee Brewers. McCullers, who waived a no-trade clause, joins the Brewers as they seek to strengthen their pitching rotation amid injuries. The Astros have not announced what they will receive in return. Read full article",
